{{!--
The <source> of the collection banner (home/row-banner.hbs) from 64rem on, where the banner is a strip about
4.6 times wider than high (the box is 280 to 286 px high; a 16:9 picture covering it would show a third of its
height and download three times what is seen). Ghost crops the picture itself, from its centre as the
banner's object-fit: cover does: theme image_sizes "banner" (1400 × 304) and "banner-xl" (2000 × 435). The strip
needs about 1316 px of width at 1× whatever the width of the screen (a narrower banner is still 280 px high), hence
sizes="1316px": 1× takes the first, any higher density the second. An SVG keeps its own format (see image/srcset.hbs).
Parameters: image=... the banner's picture
--}}
{{~#match image "~$" ".svg"~}}
  <source media="(min-width: 64rem)" srcset="{{img_url image size="banner"}} 1400w, {{img_url image size="banner-xl"}} 2000w" sizes="1316px">
{{~else match image "~$" ".SVG"~}}
  <source media="(min-width: 64rem)" srcset="{{img_url image size="banner"}} 1400w, {{img_url image size="banner-xl"}} 2000w" sizes="1316px">
{{~else~}}
  <source media="(min-width: 64rem)" srcset="{{img_url image size="banner" format="webp"}} 1400w, {{img_url image size="banner-xl" format="webp"}} 2000w" sizes="1316px">
{{~/match~}}
